<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; color: #333;">
  <h2 style="color: #007bff; text-align: center;">Reset Your Password</h2>
  <p>Hi {{fullName}},</p>
  <p>We received a request to reset your CosmicForge account password. Use the following code to continue with your password reset:</p>
  
  <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px; margin: 30px 0;">
    <h1 style="color: #007bff; font-size: 48px; letter-spacing: 15px; margin: 0;">{{otp}}</h1>
  </div>
  
  <p style="text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">This code will expire in {{expiresInMinutes}} minutes.</p>
  
  <p>If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email. Your password will not change until you enter the code and create a new one.</p>
  
  <p>Best regards,<br>The CosmicForge Team</p>
</div>
